The Rust rules: a workspace with a base crate, a binary, two plugins and the reviewed unsafe module.
Each bad edge, IO call, unsafe block and manifest problem below is one expected finding.
=== Cargo.toml
[workspace]
members = [
  "crates/*",
  "plugins/*/api",
  "plugins/*/core",
  "plugins/*/host",
]
exclude = ["crates/old"]
=== crates/old/Cargo.toml
